& [Structure]
  + strict correction lineage and supervising-proof types precede every plan
  + pure compiler emits exactly twelve child specifications and one future effect account
  + fake broker runs provider-free Prepared NotRun and Quarantined scenarios
  + explicit preparer refuses absent future physical commission while read-only verifier replays evidence directories

& [NetworkSeparation]
  + supervising governed publication performs ls-remote and commits its proof
  + preparer consumes proof bytes and local Git refs only
  + no network operation exists in the preparer plan or verifier source

& [Evidence]
  + request publication proof plan process observations topology consequences and receipt are separate strict raw forms
  + manifest rehash and deterministic double replay prevent producer-verifier laundering

& [Result]
  + provider-free implementation can prove the future preparation contract without executing it
  + physical preparation remains locked until a later exact commission
